                                                "sense_id": "bb6b8d7e-357a-34a6-ad00-c51beb8ac5ec",
                                                "text": "On 25th January, 1968, Mrs. Weston was convicted by the Sheffield Magistrates of driving without due care and attention. She was fined £10 and her driving licence was endorsed."
